# Converted from corpus/flowcharts/0116.mmd by corpus/convert.py.
User -> Client: WhatsApp / Postman / curl
Client -> Local VoiceMonkey Proxy: "POST to 127.0.0.1:18793 X-Proxy-Key"
Local VoiceMonkey Proxy -> VoiceMonkey Trigger API: GET /trigger
Local VoiceMonkey Proxy -> VoiceMonkey Announcement API: GET /announcement UTF-8 encoded query
VoiceMonkey Trigger API -> Alexa / Echo: Routine executes
VoiceMonkey Announcement API -> Alexa / Echo: Announcement spoken voice + language

Local machine { Local VoiceMonkey Proxy }
